reliquary-hard-math

The code in this package is MIT-licensed (see LICENSE).

The problem corpus shipped in reliquary_hard_math/data/problems.jsonl.gz is
derived from:

  Nemotron-Math-v2, NVIDIA Corporation
  https://huggingface.co/datasets/nvidia/Nemotron-Math-v2
  revision 8e793210, AoPS subset
  Licensed under the Creative Commons Attribution 4.0 International licence
  (CC BY 4.0): https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/

whose problems were collected from the Art of Problem Solving community forums
(https://artofproblemsolving.com/community).

Changes made: problems kept only where the reference answer is a short closed
form (no proofs, sets, inequalities, named functions or words); reference
answers trusted only when the forum answer is confirmed by at least one of
upstream's high-reasoning model solutions or is the answer of at least half of
them; duplicates and near-duplicates removed; problems overlapping
DAPO-Math-17k or the AIME, HMMT, BeyondAIME, MATH-500, AMC and Apex benchmarks
removed; answers that would need decimal approximation, and 70 references this
package's grader cannot read, removed; problem text whitespace-trimmed and an
answer-format instruction appended at serving time; problems reordered by
difficulty tier and split into train, eval and qualification. Upstream's
solutions are not included.

Every record carries its upstream source in its `source` field. The corpus is
redistributed under CC BY 4.0; this attribution must be kept with it.
